    \"m_Title\": \"\",\n    \"m_Content\": \"We multiply base texture with all 3
    colors (Base, Root, Tip) separately and then lerp with a Root/Tip masks. This
    way we can achieve white tips over the colored hair. We can also disable root&tip
    colorization and just keep everything with a single Base color.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\":
    0,\n    \"m_Theme\": 0,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\":
